+# Final skeptical report wording review
+
+Read after22:47UTC. Reviewed report snapshot REPORT_REVIEWED_AFTER_2247.md SHA600e0eb607c523a5109e734b4acfc90e549d3198c1c4b0d37cebcf88b91419c6 and final next-campaign brief SHA1825debe48e14a60cc6ad0183661470aaa7d226485cf668c940c345e2c72712e.
+
+PASS for scientific scope and attribution; no required wording correction found. The prior “full-model value” ambiguity is correctly replaced by full-unitary path trial cost4d/a.43 does not claim convergence of charged minima. Supplied SU3 dynamics are distinguished from an axiom derivation; selected infinite representations, spatial versus temporal loops, contact FDD, finite transporter nonunitarity and lack of hardware implementation retain their limits. The brief now correctly separates instrument/condition compatibility from deriving Born/Lüders values.
+
+The validation wording is appropriately bounded: full pipelines on7887 are called historical;66b merge heads, topological sync, same-byte historical-snapshot readiness replay and fresh full pipelines are separate categories. External U1 work is not credited to this campaign, and its scoped source read is not called an independent proof audit. Absent CI is not counted as passing. These status facts were not independently re-executed in this wording review; the final delivery receipt must still name actual completed/pending/unperformed current-head checks, as the report already promises.
+
+The three-sentence layman takeaway is in LAYMAN_TAKEAWAY.md. No report or science worktree was edited.
