@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+This block extends the supplied weak-coupling static-source lower bound to every complete-irrep finite Peter–Weyl cutoff R>=1, with a common window independent of cutoff, volume and separation. The argument is centered on each finite Hamiltonian's own neutral vacuum rather than subtracting unrelated variational bounds.
+
+The block42 energy upper envelope is compatible when its acceptance budget is positive. Its limiting upper envelope is the full-unitary trial cost, not an asserted limit of charged spectral minima. A separate fixed-R selected infinite-sector statement retains the same representation and acceptance premises; no R/volume interchange, representation independence, or bottom eigenvector is claimed.
+
+The source preserves the full analytical proof, root verification, four cold reviews and original parser-only failure. The live runner performs 18 controls, including all243 necessary center flows for each of two cube endpoint pairs and an explicit Ritz-subtraction counterexample. Necessary center conservation is not presented as sufficient SU3 intertwiner existence, and finite controls do not prove the imported coordinate theorem.
+
+Stacked on #8032. [Theorem](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/docs/GAUGE_WILSON_FINITE_PW_UNIFORM_STATIC_SOURCE_ENERGY_BOUNDS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-07.md), [runner](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/scripts/gauge_wilson_finite_pw_static_energy_lower_controls_2026_09_07.py), [handoff](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-static-lower-20260907/HANDOFF.md), [trace](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-static-lower-20260907/TRACE_GATE.md), [imports](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-static-lower-20260907/ASSUMPTIONS_AND_IMPORTS.md), [validation](https://github.com/jonathonreilly/qubit-lattice-axiom-framework/blob/932c62cf78e1236872852db83362801e0b0fd63f/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-static-lower-20260907/FINAL_VALIDATION.md).
+
+Full pipeline5f9bfb3bb7ba and strict lint passed; all20 affected readiness rows passed with zero failures against corrected main7887b4481feae2800c04c7c42ddac9554f2c2b9f. Conditional-support for the supplied model and explicit external theorem; no hardware compiler, axiom-selected action, merge or audit verdict.
+
+Completed parent delivery metadata was incorporated after validation with all canonical source, helper, registry and cache bytes unchanged. Artifact links are verified immutable commit URLs.
