+# Root canonical port review: block43
+
+PASS for source3a50603a272e1149dfa24bc0437c9272ad6d9f0975f2627e9e418ee6a3ebb325. Read the canonical preface and dependency/limit statements; verified full native2037554d proof occurs verbatim. Complete root verification593c0cf and four cold reviews are separately retained in the packet.
+
+The scope correctly distinguishes an R-uniform finite charged lower bound, a compatible upper envelope with a positive acceptance condition, and a separately fixed-R selected infinite-sector consequence. It centers on each cutoff's own neutral ground and does not subtract unrelated variational inequalities. The preface calls the limiting upper envelope the full-unitary trial cost and denies convergence of charged minima, representation independence and an R/volume interchange. The18 finite controls are identified as necessary center-flow and logical/geometry checks, not numerical proofs of the imported theorem or general SU3 intertwiner sufficiency.
+
+This is conditional support for the supplied model and explicit external perturbative theorem, with no hardware compiler or axiom-selected action claim. Ready for actual caching and the full repository pipeline, strict lint and nonempty readiness against the corrected-main pin. This memo is not an audit verdict or a substitute for those pending checks.
