+
+2026-09-07. Root candidate exposed before this contract; no completed root43 derivation read. Reapply the actual38 charged creation-coordinate resolvent method to full-irrep finite PW carriers R>=1, using the dimension-independent local hypotheses already audited in34. Do not compare two vacuum energies variationally. Targets: same small-coupling constants independentR, finitevolume and separation; charged free electric floor by component triality; finite ghost vacuum preservation; nonempty charged sector from bare path vacuum; combine42 only where its acceptance budget is positive. No hardware-unused-sector extension, no convergence of charged minima, no generic new confinement theorem.
+
+Falsifiers: local-dimension dependence in imported coordinate constants, lost Gauss/center covariance of cutoff, cutoff removal of fundamental path, ghost shortcut, noninvariant creation-coordinate charged sector, unjustified inverse/domain estimate. Optional fixedR selected-GNS extension will be omitted unless all hypotheses and normalization transfer are separately closed. Finite support controls, if any, are supplementary and separately declared before execution.
